/// walks up to the enclosing `NSScrollView` and hands it to the controller.
/// Mirrors `WindowMenuRegistrar` (BossMacApp.swift/DesignsView.swift)'s
/// pattern of reaching into AppKit state a SwiftUI-only view can't
/// otherwise obtain.
